<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102387" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰπεινότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lowness</i> of position, etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταπεινότητος εἵνεκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. τῆς χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς μήτρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					5.14.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of condition,
				<i>low estate, abasement</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.75
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τοσαύτην τ. καταστῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.118
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				10.74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				531.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				13.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>lowness of spirits, dejection</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιωπήν τε καὶ τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.5.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in moral
			sense, <i>baseness, vileness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				309a
			</span></i>; joined with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικροψυχία</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1384a4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> of style,
				<i>meanness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Quint.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				8.3.48
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
